// Grievances (docs/specs/phase6/unrest-and-revolt.md 3): the points each gives a household, how long an event's grievance lasts in days (0: while the condition lasts) and where a crowd carrying it goes (barn, reeve, manor, gaol).
// A household is aggrieved at 3 points. A season is 15 days, a year 60.
[
  {"type": "grievance_kind", "id": "hunger",        "points": 2, "days": 0,   "target": "barn",  "text_key": "ur_g_hunger",        "note_key": "ch_note_ur_hunger"},
